Writhing Mass is a normal [[Monsters|Enemy]] found in [[Act 3]].

== Pattern ==
{{Intents|Writhing Mass}}
On its first turn, it has an (approximately) equal chance to use {{Int|Writhing Mass|Multi Hit}}, {{Int|Writhing Mass|Big Hit}}, or {{Int|Writhing Mass|Debuff Attack}}.

'''Afterwards:'''
* {{Int|Writhing Mass|Parasite}} 10% chance
* {{Int|Writhing Mass|Block Attack}} 30% chance
* {{Int|Writhing Mass|Debuff Attack}} 20% chance
* {{Int|Writhing Mass|Multi Hit}} 30% chance
* {{Int|Writhing Mass|Big Hit}} 10% chance

{{Int|Writhing Mass|Parasite}} can only be used once.

The same move cannot be used (or rerolled via {{KW|Reactive}}) twice in a row.
